### ==============================================================================
### Airbnb Backend API - Comprehensive HTTP Client Test Suite
### Compatible with IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client & VS Code REST Client extension
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Observability & Actuator Health Checks
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Actuator Health Status (DB, Redis, Disk space)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Actuator Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Actuator Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authentication & Authorization (Pre-Seeded Accounts)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Login as Guest (John Doe)
# @name loginGuest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest@airbnb.com",
  "password": "guest123"
}

### Capture Guest JWT Token
@guestToken = {{loginGuest.response.body.token}}

### 2.2 Login as Host (Elena Rostova - Superhost)
# @name loginHost
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "host@airbnb.com",
  "password": "host123"
}

### Capture Host JWT Token
@hostToken = {{loginHost.response.body.token}}

### 2.3 Login as Admin (System Administrator)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@airbnb.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Capture Admin JWT Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Hotel Browsing, Search & Geospatial Radius Queries
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Fetch All Active Hotels (Cached via Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hotels
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Search Hotels by City & Date Range
POST {{baseUrl}}/hotels/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Paris",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2026-11-05",
  "roomsCount": 1,
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10
}

### 3.3 Geospatial Haversine Radius Search (Within 15km of Eiffel Tower)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hotels/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 48.8584,
  "longitude": 2.2945,
  "radiusKm": 15.0,
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10
}

### 3.4 Viewport Bounding Box Map Search (Paris Metro Area)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hotels/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minLatitude": 48.8000,
  "maxLatitude": 48.9000,
  "minLongitude": 2.2000,
  "maxLongitude": 2.4000,
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10
}

### 3.5 Fetch Hotel Rating Summary & Guest Favorite Badge
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/hotel/1/summary
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Dynamic Pricing Calculation
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Calculate Itemized Price Quote (Weekly Discount + Cleaning + Tax)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hotels/1/calculate-price?checkInDate=2026-11-01&checkOutDate=2026-11-08&roomsCount=1
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Booking Workflow (15-Minute Reservation Hold)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Initiate Booking Hold (Pessimistic Lock & 15-min Expire Hold)
# @name initiateBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-11-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-11-14",
  "roomsCount": 1,
  "guests": [
    {
      "name": "John Doe",
      "gender": "MALE",
      "age": 30
    }
  ]
}

### Capture Created Booking ID & Total Price
@bookingId = {{initiateBooking.response.body.id}}
@totalPrice = {{initiateBooking.response.body.totalPrice}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Payment Processing with Idempotency Key
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Process Payment (Confirm Booking, Release Hold, Schedule Escrow Payout)
# @name processPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Idempotency-Key: b3b171bf-5b23-42e7-8b01-8b21c4355a2a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "amount": {{totalPrice}},
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 6.2 Test Idempotency: Re-send with Same Idempotency-Key (Returns Cached Result Instantly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Idempotency-Key: b3b171bf-5b23-42e7-8b01-8b21c4355a2a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "amount": {{totalPrice}},
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Verified Reviews & Ratings
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Fetch Paginated Reviews for Listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/hotel/1?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Host Escrow Payouts & Administration
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Admin: View All Escrow Host Payouts
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8.2 Admin: Trigger Daily Escrow Payout Release Sweep
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/payouts/process-releases
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8.3 Admin: Trigger Manual Sweep of Stale 15-Minute Reservation Holds
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/expire-holds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Threaded Guest-Host Messaging
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 Send Message from Guest to Host (Dispatches Kafka Event + WebSocket push)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/send
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 1,
  "content": "Hi Elena! What is the WiFi password and check-in procedure?"
}

### 9.2 Fetch User Conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Accept: application/json
